{"id":"en_the-ruthless-heiress-and-her-broken-king","title":"The Ruthless Heiress and Her Broken King","titleEn":"The Ruthless Heiress and Her Broken King","description":"The world’s deadliest assassin is killed after being betrayed, only to wake up as Margaret, a maltreated heiress who has been handed over to a fight to the death. That proves to be a serious error. She slaughters everyone in her path to escape, then fixes her mismatched eyes on Andrew, a merciless billionaire bound to a wheelchair who commands terrifying, world-shattering abilities. Their shared instability pulls them into a deadly partnership. While Margaret exacts a violent reckoning on the upper classes, the king she sees as frail and broken stands prepared to destroy everything in order to shield his queen.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-ruthless-heiress-and-her-broken-king/en_US/b468ba67b12b9746/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-ruthless-heiress-and-her-broken-king/en_US/b468ba67b12b9746/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Romance","Urban","Rebirth","Female","Supernatural","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dnefe/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-ruthless-heiress-and-her-broken-king_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dnefe/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-ruthless-heiress-and-her-broken-king_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dnefe/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-ruthless-heiress-and-her-broken-king_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dnefe/?pub=4oc